{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Double Shift</strong> is a horror simulator set in a city divided into districts around a single Tower. People wait in long lines for a chance to enter, hoping for a better life inside.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>DC-0015</strong>, an inspector with more authority than most. Each day you face a line of citizens, strangers, and unsettling doubles who may look human\u2026 or not. Some beg, some lie, some smile too wide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RUN THE SCAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/3641e35681223bfe8db3489519196e0f.poster.avif?t=1761846989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/3641e35681223bfe8db3489519196e0f.webm?t=1761846989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/3641e35681223bfe8db3489519196e0f.mp4?t=1761846989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIG THE DATA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/86263a53ffba27706443effa5da4aec6.poster.avif?t=1761846989\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/86263a53ffba27706443effa5da4aec6.webm?t=1761846989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568560/extras/86263a53ffba27706443effa5da4aec6.mp4?t=1761846989\" type=\"vid